Canvas Workspace — standalone canvas surface distribution

This package adapts and bundles source from this independent canvas-workspace
checkout, extracted from Bezier/Loom commit
319e5eee556a3641d2ee68a6111a36ddc7a1eff7.
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

Adaptation: new TypeScript packaging facade, Vite library build, relocated
TypeScript declarations, explicit combined stylesheet, dependency/license audit,
and tarball-only consumer verification. Existing canvas UI and server sources
are not modified by this packaging tool.

The build consumes the current local working tree, which may include uncommitted
adaptations. dist/build-report.json records the checkout commit, source hashes,
bundled package versions and license inventory. Third-party notices and license
texts are retained under dist/third-party-licenses/.

React, React DOM and @xyflow/react are external peers and are not redistributed
as JavaScript in this package. The React Flow baseline stylesheet is included;
its upstream license is retained with the other bundled materials.

No source or runtime resource is linked to or resolved from the original checkout.
